                "text": "Medicaid is a critical program. North Dakotans rely on it to care for aging parents, children and adults with disabilities, expectant mothers in need and more.\n\nThe One Big Beautiful Bill honors those needs. Read \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/1ftK3tV2ep",
