                "text": "The \u201cAffordable\u201d Care Act was supposed to lower costs. Instead, Democrats keep masking the price tag with more subsidies to insurance companies\u2014driving costs even higher.\n\nNorth Dakotans have a word for that: irresponsible.\u00a0\n\nWatch more from my @Newsmax interview \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/PxXXSixhql",
